    "created_at": "2016-06-21T13:40:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T13:40:29Z",
    "body": "I think Chrome cancels the navigation synchronously, and tries to find an external handler for the scheme asynchronously. We could probably change that to navigate to an error page if no handler is found. What web-visible implications are you concerned about? Iframe load events?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
