    "created_at": "2016-06-21T18:03:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T18:03:33Z",
    "body": "I would expect that in Firefox clicking a link aborts the active document whether the protocol is \"known\" or not.  It sounds like it's the _Chrome_ behavior that requires knowing up front whether the protocol is \"known\"...\n",
