    "created_at": "2016-06-24T15:14:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-24T15:14:03Z",
    "body": "That is the result I get in Chrome (hard to reproduce in Firefox since `mailto:` navigates to Gmail for me there): `<iframe src=http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/cgi/test-tools/delayed-file?pause=5&mime=text/plain&text=HEY name=test></iframe><a href=mailto:a@a target=test>test</a>` (in Live DOM Viewer, just hit \"test\" within 5 seconds).\n",
