    "created_at": "2016-06-24T15:22:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-24T15:22:15Z",
    "body": "Note also that we could get that scheme as the result of a redirect. Arguably \"aborting\" shouldn't happen synchronously, but rather until we have enough information to make an informed decision, but it is probably too late for that.\n",
